UNRESOLVED CAUSE

The reviewed Application entrypoint collapses non-public exceptions into the
single S9_RUNTIME_FAILED safe code. The retained live evidence therefore cannot
distinguish the exact second exception. Further discrimination would require a
new versioned diagnostic change and another deployment. Neither is authorized
under the single-cutover R2 scope. No speculative cause is asserted.

